    },
    {
      "startMs": 124501,
      "endMs": 129571,
      "text": "And the job gets done, but you worry some, I know"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 129571,
      "endMs": 133371,
      "text": "But who wants to live forever, babe?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 133371,
      "endMs": 137471,
      "text": "You treat your mouth as if it's Heaven's gate"
    },
